WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.023 --> 00:00:01.360
(audience claps)
- Were you ever asked

00:00:01.360 --> 00:00:03.850
to do impressions of
humans at an audition?

00:00:03.850 --> 00:00:05.970
- [Cheryl] Oh no.
- Are you good at that?

00:00:05.970 --> 00:00:07.370
- Apparently, no.

00:00:07.370 --> 00:00:08.840
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:08.840 --> 00:00:10.700
I auditioned for...

00:00:10.700 --> 00:00:12.100
I think it was one of the...

00:00:13.435 --> 00:00:15.360
I don't even remember the
name of the movie now.

00:00:15.360 --> 00:00:16.193
Like a "Scream."

00:00:16.193 --> 00:00:17.280
It was one of the funny-

00:00:17.280 --> 00:00:18.350
- Like a scary movie?

00:00:18.350 --> 00:00:19.490
- [Cheryl] Oh, "Scary Movie"!

00:00:19.490 --> 00:00:20.620
- Oh, it's called "Scary Movie."

00:00:20.620 --> 00:00:21.453
Yeah, the "Scary Movies."

00:00:21.453 --> 00:00:22.286
- [Cheryl] It was like
"Scary Movie 3" or something.

00:00:22.286 --> 00:00:25.165
- [Kelly] Yeah.
- And the whole audition was.

00:00:25.165 --> 00:00:26.469
(Cheryl hesitates)

00:00:26.469 --> 00:00:27.302
(Kelly laughs)

00:00:27.302 --> 00:00:28.768
I was auditioning,

00:00:28.768 --> 00:00:29.850
in the film,

00:00:29.850 --> 00:00:34.360
the mom from the "Exorcist"
takes the priest's hat

00:00:34.360 --> 00:00:35.420
and she's about to hang it up

00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:37.400
and she catches herself in the mirror

00:00:37.400 --> 00:00:39.787
and she puts it on and realizes,

00:00:39.787 --> 00:00:43.800
"Oh, I should do a Michael
Jackson impersonation,"

00:00:43.800 --> 00:00:47.124
and so my whole audition was me,

00:00:47.124 --> 00:00:50.490
"Yee hee."
(audience laughs)

00:00:50.490 --> 00:00:55.490
And I am moonwalking
and dancing around and-

00:00:57.800 --> 00:00:58.690
- What?
- Yeah.

00:00:58.690 --> 00:01:01.770
It was one of those
out-of-body experiences.

00:01:01.770 --> 00:01:03.797
I saw myself, and I was like, "No, no.

00:01:03.797 --> 00:01:05.410
"Don't moonwalk."

00:01:05.410 --> 00:01:06.243
- [Kelly] Don't do it.

00:01:06.243 --> 00:01:07.076
- "Don't moonwalk."

00:01:07.076 --> 00:01:07.983
And I did.
- [Kelly] Did it.

00:01:07.983 --> 00:01:08.816
- Sure did.

00:01:08.816 --> 00:01:09.690
- [Kelly] You leaned in.

00:01:09.690 --> 00:01:13.298
- I leaned in and didn't get it.

00:01:13.298 --> 00:01:15.150
- [Kelly] And they leaned out.
- They leaned out.

00:01:15.150 --> 00:01:15.983
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:15.983 --> 00:01:20.510
I heard that they ended up not
using the scene in the film

00:01:20.510 --> 00:01:21.343
or something like...

00:01:21.343 --> 00:01:23.150
Somebody said something
to make me feel better.

00:01:23.150 --> 00:01:24.181
I don't know.

00:01:24.181 --> 00:01:25.020
(Kelly laughs)

00:01:25.020 --> 00:01:27.320
- I felt as they just
didn't need that part.

00:01:27.320 --> 00:01:29.720
- [Cheryl] They did not need that part.

00:01:29.720 --> 00:01:32.430
- You've been asked to do random things.

00:01:32.430 --> 00:01:34.424
- The life of an actor is crazy.

00:01:34.424 --> 00:01:35.303
- [Kelly] Yeah.

